Package: mdserve
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: unixfile <unixfile@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: git, libcap2-bin
Recommends: xdg-utils
Section: text
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/unixfile/mdserve
Description: browse trees of Markdown docs in the browser
 Run mdserve in a directory and it serves the tree on a loopback address
 of the user's own, rendered on each request. Links follow into
 other docs, code and directories, and code pages anchor lines as GitHub
 does. A visible lockfile in the directory controls the server.
